 "about": "Scripted chat tasks for the Oasis task-completion benchmark. Written by the Oasis team, so this is our own check and not an independent benchmark. Each task starts from a fresh MOCK student session. Expected end states are read from /api/state and the audit log, not from reply text. A turn is a string (a chat message) or an object: {say, sign: [roles]} signs the draft the reply asks for with that role's device key; {intake, remitter} posts text to /api/intake.",
